# Tracks · beUI design system

[beUI](https://beui.dev) is the source of truth for Tracks UI: layout chrome, forms, tables, feedback, and motion.

## Install (never hand-roll equivalents)

- Registry: `@beui` in `tracks/components.json` → `https://beui.dev/r/{name}.json`
- CLI: from `tracks/`, run `npx shadcn@latest add @beui/<slug> --yes`
- Docs for agents: [AI Agents guide](https://beui.dev/docs/ai-agents), registry index `https://beui.dev/r`, catalogue `https://beui.dev/llms.txt`
- Optional MCP: `https://mcp.beui.dev/mcp` (`list_components`, `search_components`, `get_component`, `get_install_command`)

## Where code lives

| Kind | Path |
|------|------|
| App shell / navigation | `src/components/motion/` (e.g. `animated-sidebar`, `popover-morph`) |
| Agents / resource tree | `src/components/agents/` (e.g. `ai-sidebar`) |
| beUI primitives | `src/components/motion/<slug>/` or `src/components/ui/` (shadcn install target) |
| App wrappers | `src/components/app/` — `Page`, `Dialog`, `FormShell`, `SimpleDataTable`, `InlineAlert`, `ShellMenu` |
| Page imports | `src/ui.tsx` re-exports `@/components/app` + legacy `Logo` / `Icon` |

Components copied from beUI keep the `// beui.dev/components/...` header. Customize Tracks branding via **theme tokens** in `src/styles.css` (shadcn semantic variables: `--background`, `--primary`, `--muted`, etc.), not one-off colors in components.

## Page rules

1. **Tables** — use `@/components/motion/table` (`Table`, `TableColumn`). No raw `<table className="table-wrap">` in new or touched pages.
2. **Buttons** — use `@/components/motion/button` or `@/components/ui/button` (shadcn/beUI), not `.btn` / `.btn-primary` CSS classes.
3. **Forms** — use beUI `Input`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, etc. from the registry when touching a form.
4. **Surfaces** — use beUI `Card` for grouped content instead of bespoke `.card` when refactoring.
5. **Dialogs** — use app `Dialog` (CenterMorphModal). Menus in shell use `ShellMenu` (MorphPopover).

Do not add new usages of legacy CSS (`.btn`, `.table-wrap`, `.card`, `.org-btn`, `.menu`) in `styles.css`.

## Theming

- Spec: `tracks/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`. That file is the prime base: beUI color, type, radius, motion, and catalogue.
- Tailwind v4 + `shadcn/tailwind.css` in `src/styles.css`
- Theme through the semantic tokens in that spec (`--primary` is `#0285f7`, surfaces are the neutral scale, text buttons are pills). Do not add a parallel pink/teal skin or new one-off color variables.
